## Plan

_Written by `agy` (agy, `gemini-3.8-flash-high`, medium) ([run](https://github.com/Jlore-Studios/JackiOh/actions/runs/42310549550)) before anyone built this. The night bot's builder starts from this section: edit it here to change the plan._

## Goal
Implement a unified `Tabs` component and a unified `Segmented` component with a single shared stylesheet (`tabs.css`) for menus' tabs and filter controls across the web app. Migrate `SettingsPanel` and statistics views (`/stats`) to `Tabs`, giving `stats` full WAI-ARIA arrow key navigation, roving tabindex, and panel association; migrate the leaderboard ladder toggle, stats view toggle, and collection payment options to `Segmented`, eliminating the use of `button-primary` for selected segments; standardize `<select>` filters with shared touch targets of `min-height: var(--hit-min)` (R2122000); and document why true multi-selects and long select dropdowns stay as-is.

## Files to touch

